section Slide1
let act Open
let act Close

section ConversorSetSounds
let act Action
call Chars.ActSound $char $act 5 electricidad333 0.9
call Chars.ActSound $char $act 5 desaparicion 0.6
call Chars.ActSound $char $act 8 desaparicion4 0.38 +5
